      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I am very sorry you feel this pain, but the idea that stopping life now would \"end the struggle\" is a dangerous thought I cannot support.\nYou can still give the people who love you the gift of a raw, unfiltered truth that is often more powerful than a \"good\" performance.\nFor the pain you feel to end, you don't have to let the \"self\" you are hiding to die.\nI hope you can find a safe way to talk to someone you trust before you make a decision you might live to regret.",
